## Suggested Use Order

1. Need the normal handoff gate: run `[VERIFY_COMMAND]`.
2. Need one narrow check: run the smallest focused test listed above.
3. Need to inspect/dry-run the orchestrator without UI: use `npm run runner -- ...`.
4. Need deeper semantics for why a command matters: open `docs/ENGINEERING_PLAYBOOK.md` or the project runbook.